OpenCV provides a mechanism for serializing and de-serializing its various data types
to and from disk in either YAML or XML format. In the chapter on HighGUI, which addresses user interface functions, we will cover specific functions that store and recall our
most common object: IplImages (these functions are cvSaveImage() and cvLoadImage()).

